window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When Avery showed up for his temp job on Monday morning, he had certain expectations in mind.</b></p> <p>He was not expecting to end up bent over his new boss's desk. It was an innocent mistake, and he's determined to move on, but the experience left him breathless and more than a little curious. So when his new boss is left without a feeder, he volunteers to help. After all, that's what any good assistant would do. Right?</p> <p>Ozen made foolish decisions when he was hungry. He is grateful that his new assistant is so forgiving. But when he finds himself starving after his new feeder throws a temper tantrum and refuses to show up, he has no choice but to ask his assistant for help. After all, he had yet to meet an assistant who was so professional. Surely they could get through a feeder contract without any issues. Right?</p> <p><i>Includes a bonus scene, \"A Case of Writer's Block.\"</i></p>"; 
